{"c":[{"id":"fd5a5290914f4366","sum":"Helper traps: leak-check.ts is quadratic per line (check one string per line); never edit a running bash script, mv a new one over it; never mutate w.nodes (WeakMap caches per state); focused:true from a request walk needs model.frontmostPid too.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d6128635107f5dca","sum":"Long-input traps: leak-check.ts hashes every word-bounded substring per line (quadratic; 50 KB NDJSON lines never finish, check one string per line); never edit a running bash script in place, write a new file and mv it over (B6).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T201045Z-36d6a210e08a778d","text":"leak-check.ts hashes every word-bounded substring of each line (quadratic in line length): an NDJSON with 50 KB lines never finishes; check one string per line instead.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T201045Z-88beaae782960744","text":"Never edit a running bash script in place (bash reads it as it runs); write a new file and mv it over, as B6 did with run-audit.sh mid-audit.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"894a99a3e4795948","sum":"Screen model: apply builds a new WindowState and nodes Map per snapshot (candidates.ts/descriptor.ts cache per state in WeakMaps), so never mutate w.nodes; a request walk says focused:true for a background app's window, so pair model.focusedWindowId with frontmostPid.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T201045Z-f95178d8fbcf4b52","text":"ScreenModel.apply builds a new WindowState and nodes Map per snapshot; candidates.ts and descriptor.ts cache per-state indexes in WeakMaps, so never mutate w.nodes in place.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T223858Z-64661b6aeffb7a85","text":"caret-screen's request walk (AppWorker walkWindow .request) reports focused:true for a background app's own focused window, so the helper's model.focusedWindowId alone does not mean the user is there; check model.frontmostPid (from appSwitch and frontmost focus events) too.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d3f84837adf559a9","sum":"Helper lore B8-B9: fake-app executor pauses on a click, not a key; offer expiry only in offers/lifetimes.ts; judge generator perf on real audit probes, not synthetic scenes; hand entry into a loopFinish settles first, partial matches re-offer the rest.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"364dcf1bfeba4910","sum":"Fake-app executor window is unfocused: tests pause it with a click in its frame, not a key; offer expiry lives only in offers/lifetimes.ts and records stay until offerWithdrawn (B8).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T231108Z-16725ff4ed3b6a48","text":"test/fake-app.ts's executor window is not focused, so a key userInput pauses nothing there; tests use a click inside its frame instead.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T231108Z-7306e773123a8d65","text":"Offer expiry lives only in helper/src/offers/lifetimes.ts: the host-offer registry keeps a record until its offerWithdrawn, and a loop going idle no longer withdraws its offers (B8).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4f388ef10e3dd3cf","sum":"Judge generator perf on real-window audit probes, not synthetic scenes (a 10x synthetic win slowed real cold calls, reverted, B8); hand entry into a loopFinish is judged after EDIT_SETTLE_MS: partial re-offers the rest under a new key, mismatch is stale (B9).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T021618Z-ea65f8fc10f79055","text":"Generator perf: judge changes by real-window audit probes (run-audit.sh PROBE_SECONDS, event-loop CPU via process.threadCpuUsage), not synthetic scenes; a row-sorted label index won 10x synthetically but slowed real cold calls (p95 5.3->7.4 ms) and was reverted (B8).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T032052Z-1661c0e7f0a95c07","text":"Hand entry into a loopFinish/routine is judged after EDIT_SETTLE_MS of stillness (typing passes through prefixes): partial matches re-offer the rest under a new key (offerWithdrawn reoffered + replacedBy); a mismatch is stale; all entered is taken at once (B9).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
